WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
So last month, the night before a big deadline I had, the power just went off.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The whole street, was completely dark.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
My laptop was on nine percent and I hadn't saved anything. Nothing at all.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
I sat there like, okay, that's it, I'm done.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Then my neighbour knocked with a candle and a power bank.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
I finished at two in the morning. We barely even talked. And I still owe her a piece of cake till today.